#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/architecture.md:1
#: d85397d978bc40909ee8eccdade11aa9
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Arquitectura"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/architecture.md:3
#: 2a320e4363c3424a84e0075579d29893
msgid ""
"A Python admissibility core is exposed through bounded CLI, API, and "
"browser-facing study surfaces."
msgstr ""
"Un nucleo Python de admisibilidad se expone mediante superficies de estudio "
"CLI, API y navegador acotadas."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/architecture.md:5
#: f0cc79ae2b7e4842ac980c1458838399
msgid "Data flow"
msgstr "Flujo de datos"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/architecture.md:11
#: 4d9573e9142044a5b9c9b9e47566e9c5
msgid "Provenance"
msgstr "Procedencia"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/architecture.md:13
#: aba508e445cb4861a26c003a9726410b
msgid ""
"Record the repository commit, configuration, input identifiers, execution "
"command, output location, and validation result. A screenshot alone is not a"
" reproducible artifact."
msgstr ""
"Registre el commit del repositorio, la configuracion, los identificadores de"
" entrada, el comando de ejecucion, la ubicacion de salida y el resultado de "
"validacion. Una captura por si sola no es un artefacto reproducible."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/architecture.md:15
#: 53a8ec79754d4292ac7add08ee48a3d7
msgid "Failure behavior"
msgstr "Comportamiento ante fallos"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/architecture.md:17
#: 28d408259da84f70b357486521571bf0
msgid ""
"Missing configuration, unavailable dependencies, invalid input, and failed "
"tests must remain visible. The tool must not replace a failure with invented"
" success."
msgstr ""
"La configuracion ausente, las dependencias no disponibles, una entrada "
"invalida y las pruebas fallidas deben seguir visibles. La herramienta no "
"debe reemplazar un fallo por un exito inventado."
